  "title": "Slow Cooker Chicken Stew with Wild Rice",
  "description": "This easy chicken stew with wild rice features tons of hearty vegetables simmered together in a slow cooker for a warm, comforting meal that can be prepped ahead.",
  "authors": [
    "Ms Julie"
  ],
